nflicting-status and re-plan fixtures requested by board-01 and board-02 as end-to-end acceptance evidence after repair.","Replace or define the ac1–ac7 labels in the acceptance mapping; neither the originating ISSUE nor the LLD provides their criterion text. Include explicit traceability for writer investigation and recurrence prevention.","No authored diagram definitions or rendered companions were supplied. The relationship prose can suffice; no visual verification is claimed. Live repair and implementation tests were appropriately left for implementation validation."]}],"progress":{"status":"incomplete","phase":"complete","completedChunks":5,"totalChunks":5,"lastMeaningfulActivityAt":null,"activeToolCount":0,"requiresUserInput":false,"checkpointPath":"/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json","sequence":0,"reviewElapsedMs":0,"unitElapsedMs":null,"observedAt":"2026-11-09T10:03:07.127Z","freshness":"stored"},"startedAt":"2026-11-09T09:54:08.854Z","reviewer":"daemon","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","unit":{"unitId":"consistency","phase":"chunk_review","executionId":"95c7985b-feed-48c3-b698-89d72ce08a1d","dispatches":1,"retriesUsed":0,"userDirectedDispatches":0,"diagnostics":[]},"plan":{"chunks":[{"id":"scope","title":"Issue traceability, scope and chosen approach","selectors":["/body/summary","/body/hldContextSlice","document:line:24","/body/alternativesConsidered","/body/alternativesConsidered/0","/body/alternativesConsidered/1","/body/alternativesConsidered/2","/body/chosenAlternative","/body/openQuestions","/citations/5","/citations/6"],"concerns":["Read the originating ISSUE and compare reproduction, root cause, fix intent, requirements, acceptance criteria and non-goals with the current LLD and canonical artifact.","Assess the chosen completion model and rejected alternatives against the issue; resolve applicability of standalone context without inventing HLD ancestry.","Inspect stakeholder citation provenance and wh