act-E20261109eedc4519/S001/DECISIONS.md","docs/epics/one-common-model-every-artifact-E202610192f27754d/DEF.md","docs/plans/core-data-model.md: lifecycle completion, Task ownership and migration requirements","src/workflow/artifact-core/lifecycle-service.ts: applyInQueue, completeIfRolledUp, completeMember and reopenMember","src/workflow/convert/verify.ts",".insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json: attempt 3 completedChunks scope, completion, repair and board",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-eedc4519199b24b4-s1.json: empty attachments and absence of visual definitions","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001: artifact inventory"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Coordinate completion-001 with repair-001 and board-002: live completion, repair and board derivation need consistent handling of missing or unmigrated unit heads and authoritative TASKS membership.","Resolve completion-002 before relying on repair's live-rule settlement: a later explicit override must remain auditable and available after request context disappears.","Resolve repair-003 across migration and board fixtures so plan-row identity consistently determines Task evidence, completion eligibility and displayed validation.","Retain conversion-verification regression coverage explicitly. The originating ISSUE requires it, and verifyConversion consumes the loader, graph and gates changed here.","Define or replace acceptance labels ac1–ac6 with identifiable requirement text; the originating ISSUE supplies narrative requirements rather than those numbered criteria.","Qualify the invariant that no Task completes unless its Story does: the documented partial-write recovery deliberately permits completed members before the Story head commits.","No authored or generated diagrams or renderings accompany this LLD. Relationship prose adequately describes the model; no visual verification is claimed. Verify the Task status rendering through the actual webview during implementation."]}],"progress":{"status":"changes_requested","phase":"complete","completedChunks":5,"totalChunks":5,"lastMeaningfulActivityAt":null,"activeToolCount":0,"requiresUserInput":false,"checkpointPath":"/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json","sequence":0,"reviewElapsedMs":0,"unitElapsedMs":null,"observedAt":"2026-11-09T13:07:48.472Z","freshness":"stored"},"startedAt":"2026-11-09T12:57:57.393Z","reviewer":"daemon","unit":{"unitId":"consistency","phase":"chunk_review","executionId":"775579da-579b-4af3-99fe-de9fc4970470","dispatches":1,"retriesUsed":0,"userDirectedDispatches":0,"diagnostics":[]},"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","plan":{"chunks":[{"id":"scope","title":"Issue scope, upstream requirements and design decisions","selectors":["/body/summary","/body/hldContextSlice","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/openQuestions","document:line:24","/citations/6","/citations/7","/citations/8"],"concerns":["Trace the design to the originating ISSUE reproduction, root causes, fix intent and explicit exclusions.","Read the common-model DEF and DECISIONS.md; establish applicable lifecycle requirements and authorized divergences without inventing HLD ancestry.","Assess ownership boundaries, shared contracts, scope completeness and unresolved decisions."],"dependsOn":[],"purpose":"substantive"},{"id":"completion","title":"Lifecycle completion, approval propagation and first-write integrity","selectors":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/alternativesConsidered","/body/chosenAlternative","/body/alternativesConsidered/0","/body/alternativesConsidered/1","/body/alternativesConsidered/2","/citations/0","/citations/1"],"concerns":["Inspect rollUp, unitMembers, CompletionEvidence and completeThroughService against actual lifecycle, task-round and review contracts.","Check declared-Story completeness, counted-child eligibility, cascade ownership, frozenBy attribution and reopening b