table repair, genuine unit completion and lifecycle-based board status without inventing parent HLD ancestry. Revised requirements cover partial Task creation, persisted override retries, granular repair reporting, unmatched BUILD evidence and evidence retrieval.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/summary","/body/hldContextSlice","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/openQuestions","document:line:24","/citations/6","/citations/7","/citations/8","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-eedc4519199b24b4-s1.json","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/ISSUE.md:5-38","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/DECISIONS.md","docs/epics/one-common-model-every-artifact-E202610192f27754d/DEF.md: functional requirements, constraints k3/k8, acceptance ac7-ac10 and ac27-ac29","docs/plans/core-data-model.md: Gaps 1-4, 7-8, 11-12; scope rulings; s3 binding requirements; s7 and s9 hand-offs; raw-content-writer decision","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:276-286,315-389,479-509","src/workflow/artifact-core/completion-evidence.ts:41-88","src/workflow/tasks/task-set.ts:110-185","src/workflow/delivery/load.ts:35-90"],"limitations":[],"advice":[]},{"chunkId":"completion","status":"changes_requested","summary":"The current design addresses partial initial Task creation, durable override retries, lifecycle initialization, cascade recovery and outcome propagation. One completion defect remains: an existing TASKS listing can represent an older PLAN revision after failed reconciliation, yet the live completion rule accepts it as complete.","findings":[{"id":"completion-r5-001","severity":"MED","location":"/body/dataModelChanges/0 — CompletionEvidence; LLD.md:276","message":"storyTasks accepts any nonempty TASKS listing without checking that its planRevision matches the current approved-or-later PLAN. Re-planning updates TASKS last, and reconciliation failures preserve the PLAN approval, so an interrupted reconciliation can leave the previous listing in place while newly planned Tasks remain uncreated or unlisted. If the old listed Tasks have passing rounds, the proposed live rule completes the Story without an override; unitMembers can also freeze newly created but unlisted Tasks without checking their rounds. Repair explicitly rejects this revision mismatch, but live completion has no equivalent protection. Treat a listing from an unreconciled PLAN revision as unfinished, and add live completion tests for failed and partially completed re-plan reconciliation.","evidenceReferences":["docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:276 — nonempty TASKS takes precedence without a planRevision check","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:327 — revision mismatch blocks settlement during repair","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:469 — live incomplete-set tests cover absent TASKS, not an outdated existing listing","src/workflow/tasks/task-set.ts:241 — reconcile applies changes and additions before updating TASKS at the end","src/daemon/tasks-sync.ts:66 — reconciliation failure is reported without reversing PLAN approval","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/DECISIONS.md:9 — unfinished Tasks require an explicit BUILD approval override"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/alternativesConsidered","/body/chosenAlternative","/body/alternativesConsidered/0","/body/alternativesConsidered/1","/body/alternativesConsidered/2","/citations/0","/citations/1","/citations/10","/citations/12","/Users/subhagho/work/p