n-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-eedc4519199b24b4-s1.json","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/ISSUE.md","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/DECISIONS.md",".insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json: attempt 4 report, effectiveFindingOrigins and attempt 5 completedChunks scope, completion, repair and board","docs/epics/one-common-model-every-artifact-E202610192f27754d/DEF.md: lifecycle, completion, revision and conversion requirements","docs/plans/core-data-model.md: Gaps 2–4 and 11–12; s7 requirements and conversion hand-offs","docs/epics/e1-delivery-read-model-daemon-from-E202610072ff0dfda/DEF.md: S003 acceptance criteria","src/workflow/tasks/task-set.ts: initial creation and re-plan reconciliation","src/daemon/tasks-sync.ts: reconciliation failure and preserved approval","src/workflow/artifact-core/lifecycle.ts: rollUp and unitMembers","src/workflow/artifact-core/completion-evidence.ts: stored override and latest-round evidence","src/workflow/gates.ts:945–1025","src/workflow/convert/tasks.ts:55–116","src/workflow/convert/feedback-rule.ts:85–160","src/workflow/convert/migrated-head.ts: committed log and head writes","src/workflow/artifact-core/store.ts:360–447","src/workflow/artifact-core/journal.ts: JOURNAL_DIR","src/workflow/artifact-core/repo-lifecycle.ts: durable journal wiring","src/workflow/delivery/handlers.ts: identifier validation and evidence reads","src/workflow/delivery/graph.ts: addTasks","/Users/subhagho/.insrc/daemon: reflog confirms the cited main-to-v2 checkout","Subject directory inventory and canonical envelope: LLD.md, DECISIONS.md, no visual definitions or attachments","Canonical body versus live document: contracts, model changes, errors, acceptance mapping and migration agree; canonical alternatives additionally retain pros and cons"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Retain completion-r5-001 from the completed completion chunk. An existing TASKS listing must be checked against the current approved PLAN revision before it proves completeness. This also affects board membership after interrupted reconciliation; repair already rejects that mismatch.","Preserve granular recorder coverage through nested Task creation, settlement and pending-operation replay when implementing the committed-write reporting contract.","Correct the documented approveWorkflowTarget signature to match its exported request/result contract, as noted in the completion assessment.","Relationship prose adequately describes the proposed ownership and cardinality. No visual verification is claimed; the specified webview rendering check belongs to implementation validation. Proposed tests were assessed, not executed."],"findingDecisions":[{"source":{"attempt":4,"chunkId":"completion","findingId":"completion-r4-001"},"rationale":"The current storyTasks contract treats an approved-or-later PLAN without a finished TASKS head as not-created even when partial TASK heads exist. Edge cases and tests explicitly cover a partial set whose existing Tasks passed. This resolves the original absent-TASKS defect; the distinct stale-listing defect remains recorded as completion-r5-001.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:276 — approved PLAN takes precedence over child-head fallback when TASKS is absent","LLD.md:424","LLD.md:469","src/workflow/tasks/task-set.ts: createFromPlan publishes TASKS last","Checkpoint attempt 5 completedChunks: completion"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["completion","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":4,"chunkId":"completion","findingId":"completion-r4-002"},"rationale":"The design now supplies the persisted override to the outer code-review gate for a standing approved-or-later BUILD, excludes draft revisions and requires a retry test with an actually blocking review and no request override.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §2.3 — approveWorkflowTarget","LLD.md §3.2 — persisted override consumers","LLD.md:427–428","LLD.md:472","src/workflow/gates.ts:974–1010","Checkpoint attempt 5 completedChunks: completion"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["completion","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":4,"chunkId":"repair","findingId":"repair-r4-001"},"rationale":"RepairReport now records committed writes directly instead of inferring them by plan subtraction. Its recorder covers feedback lines, migration and batch entries, heads and rounds; remaining explicitly represents retry planning. Existing TASKS heads with missing rounds receive backfill-round changes, with partial-failure tests.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:317","LLD.md:390–393","LLD.md:440","LLD.md:472","src/workflow/convert/feedback-rule.ts:114–150","src/workflow/convert/migrated-head.ts: writeMigratedHead","src/workflow/convert/tasks.ts: tasksRule and applyTasks","Checkpoint attempt 5 completedChunks: repair"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["repair","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":4,"chunkId":"repair","findingId":"repair-r4-002"},"rationale":"Backup now includes artifacts, journal and docs while writers are quiescent. Rollback stops the daemon and replaces all three directories, removing repair-created pending operations before restart. The test strategy includes failure after staging but before head replacement.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:503–506","LLD.md:472 — staged-write rollback test","src/workflow/artifact-core/journal.ts:32","src/workflow/artifact-core/store.ts: staging and completePending","Checkpoint attempt 5 completedChunks: repair"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["repair","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":4,"chunkId":"board","findingId":"board-r4-001"},"rationale":"The graph contract explicitly preserves unmatched BUILD task items and their validation/conflict contributions independently of active membership, without false migration notices. Tests cover both extra BUILD results beside PLAN rows and BUILD results without a PLAN.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §2.12 — buildWorkItemGraph postconditions","LLD.md:449–451","LLD.md:469","docs/epics/e1-delivery-read-model-daemon-from-E202610072ff0dfda/DEF.md: S003 ac4","Checkpoint attempt 5 completedChunks: board"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["board","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":4,"chunkId":"board","findingId":"board-r4-002"},"rationale":"The evidence endpoint now has an explicit contract accepting valid two-suffix TASK and DIAG identifiers through kind-aware parsing while retaining legacy acceptance and containment checks. Handler and client tests require opening sequenced DIAG evidence.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §2.11 — handleDeliveryEvidence","LLD.md:448","LLD.md:469","LLD.md:475","src/workflow/delivery/handlers.ts:42,110–135","Checkpoint attempt 5 completedChunks: board"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["board","consistency"]}]}],"progress":{"status":"changes_requested","phase":"complete","completedChunks":5,"totalChunks":5,"lastMeaningfulActivityAt":null,"activeToolCount":0,"requiresUserInput":false,"checkpointPath":"/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json","sequence":0,"reviewElapsedMs":0,"unitElapsedMs":null,"observedAt":"2026-11-09T13:48:52.408Z","freshness":"stored"},"startedAt":"2026-11-09T13:36:14.730Z","reviewer":"daemon","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","unit":{"unitId":"consistency","phase":"chunk_review","executionId":"3345bc39-1af7-4b1d-b319-2c5523aa4317","dispatches":1,"retriesUsed":0,"userDirectedDispatches":0,"diagnostics":[]},"plan":{"chunks":[{"id":"scope","title":"Issue scope, upstream requirements and recorded decisions","selectors":["/body/summary","/body/hldContextSlice","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/openQuestions","document:line:24","/citations/6","/citations/7","/citations/8"],"concerns":["Trace the current summary and accepta