n and stepwise repair reporting against captured scope.","Check ownership boundaries, shared contracts, acceptance traceability and unresolved decisions."],"dependsOn":[],"purpose":"substantive"},{"id":"completion","title":"Live completion, durable overrides and workflow-head integrity","selectors":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/alternativesConsidered","/body/chosenAlternative","/body/alternativesConsidered/0","/body/alternativesConsidered/1","/body/alternativesConsidered/2","/citations/0","/citations/1","/citations/10"],"concerns":["Inspect rollUp, storyTasks, CompletionEvidence and child readers against authoritative TASKS membership, missing heads, withdrawn/superseded Tasks, PLAN eligibility and genuinely taskless routes.","Inspect record-override across lifecycle transitions, history, approval handling and evidence readers: permitted statuses, durable actor/reason audit, revision and approval-time preservation, repeat behavior and failure handling.","Trace stored overrides through re-approval, interrupted completion, deferred signoff and repair without relying on transient request context.","Check cascade membership, frozenBy ownership, reopening, declared-Story completeness, signoff holds and partial-member recovery.","Inspect the storage helper and both production write sites for initial lifecycle creation, unchanged-content preservation, changed-revision reset and Signoff retention while preserving the stated writeArtifact behavior.","Check approval outcome propagation through daemon and CLI, committed-approval preservation, completion alternatives and relevant unit/integration tests."],"dependsOn":["scope"],"purpose":"substantive"},{"id":"repair","title":"Repair planning, ordered conversion, evidence backfill and recovery","selectors":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/migration","/citations/2","/citations/3","/citations/4","/citat