ly describes the relationship changes and small status-display addition; no new diagram or UX companion is supplied. Webview rendering source was inspected, but no rendered UI was visually verified. Retain the planned build-stage smoke test for Task status beside validation, including unmigrated status."]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"passed","summary":"Completed fresh whole-design reconciliation against the originating ISSUE, owner decisions, common-model requirements and all four completed substantive chunks. Current files match the checkpoint baseline. No additional distinct defect was found. The substantive chunks retain six MED findings; this consistency chunk passing does not clear those findings.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-eedc4519199b24b4-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/ISSUE.md","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/DECISIONS.md","docs/epics/one-common-model-every-artifact-E202610192f27754d/DEF.md: completion, revision, migration and non-goal requirements","docs/plans/core-data-model.md:84-90, revision requirements and recorded conversion decisions",".insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json: attempt 3 report and attempt 4 completedChunks scope, completion, repair and board","src/workflow/tasks/task-set.ts:125-183","src/workflow/gates.ts:945-1020","src/workflow/artifact-core/lifecycle.ts: CompletionEvidence, countedChildren, rollUp and unitMembers","src/workflow/artifact-core/lifecycle-service.ts: completion, member freezing and reopening","src/workflow/artifact-core/journal.ts:32-120","src/workflow/artifact-core/store.ts:360-447","src/workflow/convert/tasks.ts:55-116","src/workflow/convert/feedback-rule.ts:88-145","src/workflow/convert/verify.ts","src/workflow/delivery/handlers.ts: artifact-id validation and evidence retrieval","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001: file inventory; canonical artifact contains no visual definitions or attachments"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Address completion-r4-001 across live completion, repair reconstruction and board membership: existing Task heads do not prove that an interrupted TASKS creation produced the complete planned set.","Address completion-r4-002 before relying on re-approval recovery. The stored override must reach the outer code-review gate as well as downstream completion evidence.","Address repair-r4-001 and repair-r4-002 together: accurate partial-write reporting and rollback must account for sidecar writes, Task rounds and durable journal operations.","Retain board-r4-001 and board-r4-002: authoritative active membership must preserve unmatched BUILD validation evidence, and DIAG admission must extend through evidence retrieval.","Define the requirement text behind acceptance labels ac1–ac6, or replace them with identifiable ISSUE requirement references.","Relationship prose adequately describes the proposed model. No authored or generated visual artifacts accompany this LLD, and no visual verification is claimed. Perform the specified Task-status webview rendering check during implementation."],"findingDecisions":[{"source":{"attempt":3,"chunkId":"completion","findingId":"completion-001"},"rationale":"The current design validates explicitly listed missing Task heads and distinguishes taskless routes from zero-head incomplete creation. Its child-head fallback still permits partially created sets to appear complete. The fresh completion finding identifies this remaining membership defect more precisely.","evidenceReferences":["docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:44","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:218","src/workflow/tasks/task-set.ts:148-183",".insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json: attempt 4 completion finding completion-r4-001"],"action":"superseded","reviewedInChunkIds":["completion","consistency"],"supersededBy":{"chunkId":"completion","findingId":"completion-r4-001"}},{"source":{"attempt":3,"chunkId":"completion","findingId":"completion-002"},"rationale":"The LLD now defines an audited record-override operation, its permitted statuses, unchanged approval/revision fields, persistent evidence readers and deferred-completion tests. This resolves the missing persistence contract. The separate outer-gate retry defect remains recorded as completion-r4-002.","evidenceReferences":["docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:82-90","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:225-233","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:397",".insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json: attempt 4 completion assessment"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["completion","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":3,"chunkId":"repair","findingId":"repair-001"},"rationale":"Repair now explicitly runs renaming and amendment conversion before feedback and head migration, preserves the prerequisite ordering, and includes uppercase-head/feedback and approved-flat-amendment fixtures.","evidenceReferences":["docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:267","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:397","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md:429",".insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json: attempt 4 repair assessment"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkI