/delivery/delivery-client.ts","vscode-plugin/src/delivery/board-details.ts","vscode-plugin/src/delivery/board-views.ts","vscode-plugin/src/delivery/board-protocol.ts: TaskRowView","vscode-plugin/src/delivery/board-host.ts: task table webview source","vscode-plugin/src/delivery/labels.ts","jetbrains-plugin: searched current sources for workflow.delivery consumers; none found"],"limitations":[],"advice":["The planned implementation webview smoke test remains future validation; no rendered UI was verified in this design review.","When implementing, retain the existing unmatched-result regressions alongside the newly specified failed-result, migration-notice and sequenced-DIAG tests. Tests were inspected, not executed."]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"passed","summary":"Completed fresh whole-design reconciliation against the ISSUE, owner decisions, applicable upstream requirements and all four completed substantive assessments. The live and canonical artifacts match the checkpoint baseline. All six carried findings are resolved by current design changes. No additional distinct defect was found. The substantive completion finding completion-r5-001 remains blocking; this consistency result does not clear it.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-eedc4519199b24b4-s1.json","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/ISSUE.md","docs/standalone/make-delivery-board-read-common-artifact-E20261109eedc4519/S001/DECISIONS.md",".insrc/tmp/design-review/delivery-board-lld-s1.json: attempt 4 report, effectiveFindingOrigins and attempt 5 completedChunks scope, completion, repair and board","docs/epics/one-common-model-every-artifact-E202610192f27754d/DEF.md: l